### Obtener avisos de mantenimiento programados por horómetro (sin filtros) — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/scheduledNoticesByHourmeter
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Con filtros de operador/organización/división/subdivisión — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/scheduledNoticesByHourmeter?operatorId=1&organizationId=1&divisionId=1&subdivisionId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sin token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/scheduledNoticesByHourmeter

### Filtro con tipo inválido (organizationId no numérico) → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/scheduledNoticesByHourmeter?organizationId=abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
